# Language statistics overrides for GitHub Linguist.
#
# The solution write-ups in these folders are Markdown files whose substance is
# fenced code. Linguist classifies one language per file and never looks inside
# fences, so by default all of that code is invisible in the repository's
# language bar. These rules reclassify those files by the language they teach.
#
# This affects language statistics, source-view syntax highlighting, and diff
# colouring only. It does NOT affect Markdown rendering, which GitHub keys on
# the .md extension via github/markup. The files still render as Markdown.

LeetCode/**/*.md  linguist-language=C++ linguist-detectable=true
Domain/**/*.md    linguist-language=C++ linguist-detectable=true
Companies/**/*.md linguist-language=C++ linguist-detectable=true
SQL/*.md          linguist-language=SQL linguist-detectable=true
